==Overview==
The '''security guard toilet''' is an enemy that was added in update 70 (Part 2). It has a very high amount of health and appears in the late game. It appears in [[Nightmare Mode]]. It has 2 lasers that it can use to stun units. It is an incredibly powerful toilet that can charge through your defenses.

He has a grey toilet, a light grey amour plate, 2 darker grey lasers, a black helmet with a flashlight with a similar appearance to the lasers he has, he also has the same roblox face as the [[Soldier Rocket Toilet]] and the [[Toxic Mutant Toilet]].

== Abilities ==
*Laser Attack: Attacks a unit with its lasers, stunning it for (??) seconds.

==Strategy==

*The '''Security Guard Toilet''' has a lot of health, but is very slow, so you should use high DPS units to defeat this enemy such as: the [[Jetpack Cameraman]], [[Jetpack Mace Cameraman]], [[Upgraded Titan Cameraman]] etc.
*It stuns units but not that frequently so don't worry, still recommended to bring a healing unit such as: [[Medic Cameraman]], [[Camera Repair Drone]] or [[Speaker Repair Drone]].

==Trivia==

*The '''Security Guard Toilet''' is based off the [https://skibidi-toilet.fandom.com/wiki/Laser_Guardian_Skibidi_Toilet#Flashlight_Laser_Guardian_Skibidi_Toilet Flashlight Laser Guardian Skibidi Toilet]. 

